<p>1. Aye laal jab khareedoge maqtal ki tum zamee'n<br> rakhna khayal ho wo zamee'n neher ke qareeb<br> jab neher se sakina ko paani pilaoge<br> maa aayegi hussain..(2)</p> 
<p>2. Rakhna qadam zameen par lekar ali ka naam<br> karna na bhulna abu talib ko tum salam<br> bint e asad ki nazr waha jab dilaoge<br> maa aayegi hussain..(2)</p> 
<p>3. Baade namaz e jung ka aaghaz dekhne<br> hurr jaise jaanesar ka andaaz dekhne<br> ghode pe hurr ko padhke dua jab bithaoge<br> maa aayegi hussain..(2)</p> 
<p>4. Waqt e sahar azaa'n ali akbar ki hogi jab<br> doobega khoon roke waha'n mahtab e shab<br> aur tum safe namaz e shahadat pe jaoge<br> maa aayegi hussain..(2)</p> 
<p>5. Karke khizaab khoon se asghar ki laash par<br> thaame hue jigar ko jhukae hue nazar<br> laasha, laasha garam zameen mein jis dum chupaoge<br> maa aayegi hussain..(2)</p> 
<p>6. Wo hausla bhi dekhne beta mai aaungi<br> lekin nigaahe tujhse mai kaise milaungi<br> mayyat jawan laal ki jab tum uthaoge<br> maa aayegi hussain..(2)</p> 
<p>7. Jab zeen na zameen par hoga tera badan<br> teero pe laash hogi teri jab ke bekafan<br> tum amma amma kehke hume jab bulaoge<br> maa aayegi hussain..(2)</p> 
